title: macOS Clipboard Capture via pbpaste
id: 38d68d78-70ff-42ef-8d22-12f90f743266
status: experimental
description: Detects use of pbpaste to read clipboard contents, potentially in a loop, to harvest copied passwords, tokens, and sensitive text on macOS.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1115/
logsource:
  product: macos
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    Image|endswith: '/pbpaste'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - User
  - Image
falsepositives:
  - Scripts legitimately using the clipboard
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.collection
  - attack.t1115
